{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">飲食節目《美食新聞報道》繼續帶大家四出覓食！首站由對飲食極有要求的劉Sir帶領林映暉，展開一場日式尋味之旅；隨後林映暉再會合波波（黃婧靈），前往銅鑼灣體驗極具藝術氣息的特色下午茶，享受視覺與味覺的雙重盛宴！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站劉Sir帶著林映暉造訪一間主打精緻江戶前料理的餐廳，品嚐多款展現極致刀工與食材原味的上乘佳餚：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鮨宏 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：北角渣華道8號威邦商業中心地下13號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4d5d93b7-fd6e-42ee-9012-b15a0c094295.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026EE80SB90XH1791255197.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4d5d93b7-fd6e-42ee-9012-b15a0c094295.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"09ad8d48-daac-4159-8aff-e8a914ddcd11.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026EUlj7TAlOA1791255200.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"09ad8d48-daac-4159-8aff-e8a914ddcd11.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"43cda61c-8520-4aa1-bd5b-4aad0416efb7.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026IRpJKXK2nm1791255200.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"43cda61c-8520-4aa1-bd5b-4aad0416efb7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"26a81e35-b47e-4347-839a-a18fa2c4da35.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026llWrTrIWL21791255199.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"26a81e35-b47e-4347-839a-a18fa2c4da35.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後，林映暉與波波（黃婧靈）來到銅鑼灣一間主打浪漫優雅氛圍的餐廳，體驗兼具視覺與味覺雙重享受的「凡爾賽靈感畫下午茶」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這款特色下午茶將美食與藝術繪畫完美結合。店家特別於餐桌上架起小型畫架與特製的白色食案「畫板」，並提供多款特調果醬、香滑忌廉、鮮果切片及食用花卉等豐富材料作為「顏料」。顧客可以發揮靈感創意，化身藝術家，將各式醬料與新鮮食材自由 DIY 擺置於畫板之上，打造出獨一無二的專屬藝術作品，一邊打卡創作一邊細味浪漫美味！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Royal Inn （分店） </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：銅鑼灣告士打道311號皇室堡3樓313-314號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8bf65123-41c8-4b5b-8eee-036dff6b05b2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Y4SKqmZsex1791255199.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8bf65123-41c8-4b5b-8eee-036dff6b05b2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"488b78da-2a46-40a9-a7ca-4450a759d7e0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026NvBaHS59Sm1791255198.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"488b78da-2a46-40a9-a7ca-4450a759d7e0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T03:20:05.996729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}